Error [E0121]: `arena` was consumed by `close`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/mem_use_after_free.jet:9:10
    |
  9 |     y :: arena.alloc(2)
    |          ^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/mem_use_after_free.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     close(^arena)
    |            ^^^^^ `arena` moved to `close` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `arena` after the move, or give `close` a copy with `arena.copy()` where it moved.
 Note: acquire a new `Arena` resource; closed resources cannot be copied or reused
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
